  "createdAt": "2026-09-09T00:36:50.819362Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T08:47:54.157924Z",
  "totalBlocks": 42,
  "translatedBlocks": 42,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8462ee88a6dc6f3b",
      "translationZh": "我可能有些偏心，但我觉得 Dependabot 相当棒。它帮助我的项目保持最新状态，确保我始终使用安全的库。不过，由于新漏洞频频出现，Dependabot 也会频频发起新的拉取请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbbe5c9b7544c530",
      "translationZh": "有时是小版本更新，有时是大版本升级。有时一切都能正常运行。而有时……嗯，每个开发者都曾被破坏性变更打个措手不及。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d4592f79ff0931b",
      "translationZh": "我们怎样才能最好地对这些拉取请求进行分类处理？这项工作本身并不特别难，但确实很重复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24b266139ce90e9e",
      "translationZh": "这正是适合交给 Copilot 的任务！借助 GitHub Copilot 应用中的自动化功能，你可以把第一轮审查交出去。你不必手动检查每一个 Dependabot 拉取请求，而是可以创建一个自动化任务，审查尚未关闭的拉取请求，按风险将它们分组，核查 CI 状态，并在你开始一天的工作之前提供摘要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e9e2e6338d0702e",
      "translationZh": "按照以下步骤，构建一个每天对 Dependabot 拉取请求进行分类处理的自动化任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b5c81e38afc3e815",
      "translationZh": "第 1 步：创建新的自动化任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "110a9723142d26b1",
      "translationZh": "在 GitHub Copilot 应用中，创建一个新的自动化任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d35442ebd1fd6742",
      "translationZh": "你首先需要配置两项内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "40e015deb348c67f",
      "translationZh": "名称：为自动化任务起一个描述性名称，例如“每日 Dependabot 分诊”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af0aaccf533b004a",
      "translationZh": "触发条件：决定何时运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9988557a781563b1",
      "translationZh": "可用的触发选项包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8501fa94487d14d5",
      "translationZh": "创建议题时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b84d84d3f2dabb52",
      "translationZh": "对于 Dependabot 审查这类周期性维护任务，每日运行的计划通常是个不错的选择。例如，你可以安排它在你开始一天的工作之前运行，这样登录时结果就已准备就绪。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "629432e15bc789c0",
      "translationZh": "你还可以选择让自动化任务在云端还是在本地计算机上运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "adb12b3738bb1f4e",
      "translationZh": "第 2 步：用自然语言描述任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b15e28fa3a84f95d",
      "translationZh": "接下来，告诉 Copilot 你希望它做什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "888e799ecbfc835d",
      "translationZh": "由于提示词使用自然语言，你可以对其进行自定义，以匹配团队的工作流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e04841ac4cbcbc35",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：选择仓库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cbae4a1553041c2",
      "translationZh": "选择自动化任务应分析的仓库或项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96c0a9f1926496d8",
      "translationZh": "选定仓库后，创建自动化任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f90c0f49a8ef9d4",
      "translationZh": "如果你想立即测试，而不是等待计划运行，请选择 Create and Run。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fe6676456030e2b2",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：查看结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe5a2950ce9a2ab6",
      "translationZh": "自动化任务完成后，Copilot 会返回一份摘要，而不是逐条列出拉取请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f437f8882a0afb66",
      "translationZh": "将安全的补丁更新归为一组",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ccc871fd4e6044a2",
      "translationZh": "将次要版本升级与主要版本升级分开",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "16b3acadd3d5b3d2",
      "translationZh": "识别哪些拉取请求已通过 CI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d1047dcbba3ff5ed",
      "translationZh": "突出显示需要进一步调查的依赖项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ac67ac881f31fb4",
      "translationZh": "你无需让几十个小决策打断早晨的工作，而是可以快速识别哪些更新已准备好合并，哪些值得更仔细地关注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c14a30caab307117",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5：在 Copilot 会话中继续工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c81016f35c2b49f",
      "translationZh": "如果某项更新需要额外工作，你可以直接从自动化结果继续处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82fa4aded5fe2e9c",
      "translationZh": "例如，如果摘要指出某个框架需要进行主要版本升级，你可以从结果中启动一个新的 Copilot 会话，并请 Copilot 帮助完成迁移。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e37a15e1d09d8c9a",
      "translationZh": "由于会话启动时已带有自动化的上下文，你无需再次收集这些信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "38fa3affd63107a4",
      "translationZh": "查看以往的自动化运行记录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52c5ee3acdb2763a",
      "translationZh": "每次自动化运行都会被保存，方便你查看：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c800ce6f03b381c",
      "translationZh": "它执行了哪些操作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6166dcd681756d3",
      "translationZh": "它产生了哪些结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65e4afaba92b984f",
      "translationZh": "保留每次运行的历史记录，让自动化过程更加透明。你随时都可以回顾发生了什么，而不必将它们视为黑箱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ef85c703b64418c5",
      "translationZh": "将重复性工作转为后台工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd03c9d0e3210341",
      "translationZh": "Dependabot 问题分诊就是适合自动化的周期性任务的一个好例子。你只需描述一次工作流，选择它的运行时间，然后让 Copilot 自动执行那些重复性步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25ebee0de1de18d6",
      "translationZh": "如果你刚开始使用自动化功能，可以从一项你已经能不假思索地完成的任务入手。让 Copilot 处理日常工作，这样你就能把时间花在需要你运用专业知识做出的决策上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a5e5ebd24fd3c2e",
      "translationZh": "准备好自动化处理你的下一个周期性任务了吗？在 GitHub Copilot app 中创建你的第一个自动化任务 >",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edad892d5496f6b0",
      "translationZh": "文章《GitHub Copilot app 入门：自动化处理 Dependabot 拉取请求的分类评估》最先发表于 The GitHub Blog。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
